<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's March PPI rises 3.8 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's March PPI rises 3.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's producer price index (PPI) rose 3.8 percent in March on the year, up from a 2.2 percent year-on-year rise a year earlier, Ministry of Finance and Economy figures showed on Sunday.</p>
<p>					  March     Feb     March 96</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, yr-on-yr)	    +3.8     +3.6	+2.2</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, month-to-month)    -0.2     +0.6	-0.3</p>
<p>    PPI (base=1990)		 123.2    123.4     118.7</p>
<p>The ministry said the producer price index (PPI) rose 3.5 percent in 1996, against 3.4 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
